<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (It is crucial for individuals, businesses, and governments to prioritize continuous learning. Training programs should focus on AI-complementary skills such as analytical thinking, digital literacy, automation oversight, and technical problem-solving. Investing in workforce development will reduce job displacement risk and empower employees to adapt to new opportunities.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
