>>
endobj
268 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Organizations should adopt AI in ways that enhance human capabilities rather than fully replace them. Ethical guidelines, transparency in AI decision-making, and human oversight should be embedded into AI-related processes. This ensures that automation aligns with organizational values and supports social and economic well-being.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [7]
>>
